!2026514-V7:三体重复检查,氢气概率检查
!三体O*,O2+H=O+OH口算错误,考虑化学键断键方式重新计算概率
!duplicate反应根据Mine_18机理chemkin取点拟合参数
!标记反应
!双氧的单*标记在后OO*，双*记为O*2
!H2OO*与H2O*O不作区分，统一都标记在后
!O*不作为新增elements，作为species
!C相关的先不改写,反应式后系数等先不标*
!删去注释掉的反应
ELEMENTS
O
H
N
C
AR
HE 
END

SPECIES
AR
HE
N2
H
H2
O       O*
OH      O*H
H2O     H2O*
HO2     HO*2   HOO*
H2O2    H2OO*  H2O*2
O2      OO*    O*2
OH*     !化学荧光                           
N
NH
NH2
NH3
NNH
N2H2
N2H3
N2H4
H2NN    
NO      NO*
N2O     N2O*
NO2     NOO*   NO*2
HNO     HNO*
HON     HO*N
HONO    HONO*  HO*NO  HO*NO*
H2NO    H2NO*
HNOH    HNO*H
HNO2    HNOO*  HNO*2
!HONO2   HONOO* HONO*O*  HO*NO*2
NO3     NOOO*  NOO*O*   NO*3
HNO3    HNOOO* HNOO*O*  HNO*3
NH2OH   NH2O*H
!CO      CO*
!CO2     COO*   CO*2
!HCO     HCO*
!CH4     C2H6    !The two C1-C2 species are only defined as three-body colliders in this model
END
!--Framework of Present Model---------------------------------------------------------------------------!
!-1 H2/CO mechanism reactions                                                                           !
!                |-1.1 H2-O2 Chain Reactions                                                            !
!                |-1.2 H2-O2 Dissociation Reactions                                                     !
!                |-1.3 HO2                                                                              !
!				 |-1.4 H2O2                                                                             !
!				 |-1.5 CO                                                                               !
!			                                                 
!-2 Ammonia reactions                                                                                   !
!                |-2.1 N/N2                                                                             !
!				 |-2.2 NH                                                                               !
!				 |-2.3 NH2                                                                              !
!				 |-2.4 N2H2                                                                             !
!				 |-2.5 N2H4                                                                             !
!				 |-2.6 N2H3                                                                             !
!				 |-2.7 H2NN                                                                             !
!				 |-2.8 HNOH                                                                             !
!				 |-2.9 NH3                                                                              !
!				 |-2.10 NNH                                                                             !
!				 |-2.11 HNO                                                                             !
!				 |-2.12 HON                                                                             !
!				 |-2.13 NO                                                                              !
!				 |-2.14 NO2                                                                             !
!				 |-2.15 N2O                                                                             !
!				 |-2.16 H2NO                                                                            !
!				 |-2.17 HONO                                                                            !
!				 |-2.18 HNO2                                                                            !
!				 |-2.19 HONO2                                                                           ! 
!				 |-2.20 NO3                                                                             !

